# Aura Player Environment Configuration

# ==============================================
# OPTIONAL: Last.fm API (Recommended!)
# ==============================================
# Get your free API key from: https://www.last.fm/api/account/create
# Benefits: Better recommendations, trending charts, genre discovery
# Setup time: 2 minutes
# LASTFM_API_KEY=your_lastfm_api_key_here

# ==============================================
# OPTIONAL: Spotify API (Advanced)
# ==============================================
# Get credentials from: https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
# Benefits: Enhanced search quality, better metadata
# Setup time: 10 minutes (requires OAuth setup)
# Note: Requires Spotify Premium for full functionality
# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=your_spotify_client_id_here
# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=your_spotify_client_secret_here
# SPOTIFY_REDIRECT_URI=your_app_redirect_uri_here

# ==============================================
# NOTES
# ==============================================
# - JioSaavn works out of the box (no setup required!)
# - Last.fm is highly recommended for better recommendations
# - Spotify is optional and requires more setup
# - All features work on mobile, desktop, and web
